## Config contract (INI)

If you change configuration behavior (new key, rename, default change, semantics):

- update **`CONFIG.md`** (authoritative description)
- update **`config/config.example.ini`** (example reflects reality)
- add a **migration note** when the change can break existing setups

Rules:
- config changes must be reflected in **acceptance criteria** and **test plan**
- avoid “silent behavior changes” without docs and verification

